{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29212","headline":"途中逢故人话西山读书早曾游览 · 许浑","name":"途中逢故人话西山读书早曾游览","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西岩曾到读书堂，穿竹行沙十里强。\n湖上梦余波灩灩，岭头愁断路茫茫。\n经过事寄烟霞远，名利尘随日月长。\n莫道少年头不白，君看潘岳几茎霜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}